OL,3,ARussia 'purposefully' hit critical
OL,4,Ainfrastructure in latest strikes, Kyiv
OL,5,Amayor says
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Thursday, Kyiv's mayor Vitali
OL,8,FKlitschko warned residents of
OL,9,FDesnyansky and part of the Dnipro
OL,10,Fdistricts may experience a disrupted
OL,11,Fsupply of hot water, following the
OL,12,Fovernight attacks.
OL,14,F"Specialists are working to restore the
OL,15,Fdamaged infrastructure," he said on
OL,16,FTelegram, external.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
